        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Margaret Atwood\n- Works: Writing with Intent: Essays, Reviews, Personal Prose--1983-2005\n- Awards: Arthur C. Clarke Award, Prince of Asturias Award for Literature, Booker Prize, Governor General's Award\n\nFacts:\n- Margaret Atwood is a Canadian author.\n- In 2006, Margaret Atwood published Writing with Intent: Essays, Reviews, Personal Prose--1983-2005, a collection of essays.\n- Margaret Atwood has won the Arthur C. Clarke Award and the Prince of Asturias Award for Literature.\n- Margaret Atwood was shortlisted for the Booker Prize five times and won it once.\n- Margaret Atwood was a finalist for the Governor General's Award several times and won it twice.",
